SUMMARY:AES — Call #1
DESCRIPTION:Reach out to your dealer to confirm timing and availability\n\n
 Issuer: AES CORP (AES)\nRoadshow: https://markets.jpmorgan.com/event_booki
 ng/loadEvent?eventToken=136314_39f923c3-0648-4ada-b396-f4ff4da55323\n\nDea
 l context:\nThe AES Corporation (AES)\, rated Baa3/BBB-/BBB- (Moody's/S&P/
 Fitch\, all Stable outlook)\, is bringing a two-tranche SEC Registered sen
 ior unsecured note offering consisting of a 3-year (due Jul 15\, 2029) and
  a 7-year (due Jul 15\, 2033)\, both USD Benchmark in size\, with initial 
 price talk of T+150a and T+180a respectively. The deal is led by JPM (B&D)
 \, WFS\, CITI\, GS\, and SMBC\, with proceeds earmarked for repayment of e
 xisting indebtedness and general corporate purposes\, settling T+3 on June
  16\, 2026. Notable structural features include a Make Whole Call on both 
 tranches\, a Par Call 2 months prior to maturity on the 7-year\, a Tax Cre
 dit Call at 101%\, and a Change of Control put at 101% (with an exception 
 for the GIP/EQT Transaction).
